nouveau-utils (2.2.3-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Release v2.2.3: De-bounce interrupt load detection on 120Hz/144Hz displays.
  * Raise default INTERRUPT_THRESHOLD from 100 to 250 IRQs/s to eliminate false-positive
    3D boost triggers caused by high-refresh vertical blanking interrupts at idle.

